Package: blockwallet
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Self-custody Bitcoin and Ethereum wallet
 Block Wallet is a GTK4/libadwaita self-custody wallet for the Librem 5
 and other Linux phones. Keys stay on the device in an encrypted store
 under XDG directories. Bitcoin uses BIP84 native SegWit via BDK; Ethereum
 uses BIP44 via Alloy. Point both chains at your own servers.
 .
 Do not store mainnet funds until you have completed the Librem 5 test
 checklist in docs/LIBREM5.md.
